    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Ice Zoo",
      "",
      "Lots of people like zoos. In Northeastern China, there is an even more interesting zoo—an ice zoo.",
      "",
      "Northeastern China is extremely cold. It snows for four or five months each year.",
      "In such cold weather, going out to play is also different from other places—they play with snow and ice.",
      "There was a guy in the Northeast who found the winters very boring, so he went outside to carve animals out of ice. The animals looked real.",
      "",
      "Slowly, people came to see this guy's ice zoo. Do you think he should charge money?"
    ]
  }
